{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sanity Protocol",
    "steam_appid": 3831970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/f2364242bd71fe418061dc32dbd2bd4e.avif?t=1755442249\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a decaying psychiatric hospital run by a manipulative psychiatrist, patients wander the halls with no memory of who they are or what was done to them. But you remember. You're not a patient. You're here to find your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguised as one of them, you must navigate a collapsing system of secrets, paranoia, and experimental treatments. Blend in. Stay undetected and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more your mind and your body begin to betray you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/99ef0bb9e5aa4194e4ebafbe6bc95918.avif?t=1755442249\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror RPG with a turn-based battle system where you fight with your emotions and thoughts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill check system based on mind &amp; body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your sanity decreases, you become more anxious, paranoid, or even psychotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere where paranoia, isolation and altered perception blur the line between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can be approached in multiple ways. Talk your way in, sneak around, or hack through locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter: dialogue, trust, access, and consequences change based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions can be failed, but the story adapts and continues. Creating a different path for every player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep deprivation, medication, therapy sessions and traumas affect what you see, hear, and say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, collect evidences and uncover secrets.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/f2364242bd71fe418061dc32dbd2bd4e.avif?t=1755442249\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a decaying psychiatric hospital run by a manipulative psychiatrist, patients wander the halls with no memory of who they are or what was done to them. But you remember. You're not a patient. You're here to find your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguised as one of them, you must navigate a collapsing system of secrets, paranoia, and experimental treatments. Blend in. Stay undetected and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more your mind and your body begin to betray you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/99ef0bb9e5aa4194e4ebafbe6bc95918.avif?t=1755442249\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror RPG with a turn-based battle system where you fight with your emotions and thoughts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill check system based on mind &amp; body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your sanity decreases, you become more anxious, paranoid, or even psychotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere where paranoia, isolation and altered perception blur the line between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can be approached in multiple ways. Talk your way in, sneak around, or hack through locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter: dialogue, trust, access, and consequences change based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions can be failed, but the story adapts and continues. Creating a different path for every player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep deprivation, medication, therapy sessions and traumas affect what you see, hear, and say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, collect evidences and uncover secrets.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Sanity Protocol is a psychological horror RPG where you infiltrate a mental hospital to rescue your sister. No one remembers why they\u2019re here. Except you. Pretend to be a patient. Fight your emotions and thoughts in turn based battles. Talk, deceive, hack and survive. Stay quiet. Stay sane.",
